<title>SINGAPORE: Times Publishing buys Hong Kong office.</title>
<headline>Times Publishing buys Hong Kong office.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Times Publishing Ltd said on Friday its wholly-owned Hong Kong subsidiary, Federal Publications Ltd, had bought office space for HK$40.5 million.</p>
<p>The purchase of the 12,815 sq ft of offices at Sea View Estate, North Point in Hong Kong, was made in cash, a company statement said.</p>
<p>The purchase was not expected to have any impact on the company's earnings for the year ending August 31, 1997, it added.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
